e 1970s.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-1933-woolworth-heiress-barbara-hutton-ordered-a-rolls-royce-for-a-georgian-prince-he-died-crashing-that-car-but-it-survived-crossed-the-atlantic-aboard-the-qe2-and-sold-for-166750-in-2026/articleshow/135069162.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-1933-woolworth-heiress-barbara-hutton-ordered-a-rolls-royce-for-a-georgian-prince-he-died-crashing-that-car-but-it-survived-crossed-the-atlantic-aboard-the-qe2-and-sold-for-166750-in-2026/articleshow/135069162.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-20T18:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135069427,imgsize-2132017.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Nobody told me..that's very confusing': Indian man Kamlesh Shah charged with election fraud in US says he didn't know he was not supposed to vote]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135070169.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/nobody-told-me-thats-very-confusing-indian-man-kamlesh-shah-charged-with-election-fraud-in-us-says-he-didnt-know-he-was-not-supposed-to-vote/articleshow/135070169.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/nobody-told-me-thats-very-confusing-indian-man-kamlesh-shah-charged-with-election-fraud-in-us-says-he-didnt-know-he-was-not-supposed-to-vote/articleshow/135070169.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-20T18:01:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135070255,imgsize-22396.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Australian lawmaker Helen Haines loses leg after being hit twice by car: Report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135069793.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Independent lawmaker Helen Haines was gravely injured when a man reportedly collided with her vehicle. This alarming event unfolded outside her office in Wangaratta, Victoria, as she was loading items from her car. Eyewitnesses claim the driver intentionally hit her car twice before escaping. A brave bystander managed to restrain the driver until the police arrived and took him into custody.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/australian-lawmaker-helen-haines-loses-leg-after-being-hit-twice-by-car-report/articleshow/135069793.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/australian-lawmaker-helen-haines-loses-leg-after-being-hit-twice-by-car-report/articleshow/135069793.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-20T17:47:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135069937,imgsize-51656.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Amy Winehouse’s first Camden flat returns to market for £650,000 after 23 years]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135063955.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/amy-winehouse-bought-her-first-camden-flat-in-2003-with-money-from-her-debut-album-frank-23-years-later-the-two-bedroom-home-has-returned-to-the-market-for-650000/articleshow/135063955.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/amy-winehouse-bought-her-first-camden-flat-in-2003-with-money-from-her-debut-album-frank-23-years-later-the-two-bedroom-home-has-